<title>USA: Comerica Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Comerica Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.04		    $0.91</p>
<p> Net			121,518		  105,302</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 112,538		  115,993</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net income applicable to common stock $116,768,000 vs $105,302,000.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 net interest income $353,267,000 vs $323,324,000.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 non-interest income $116,328,000 vs $124,389,000.  </p>
<p>Q3 1996 non-interest income includes $6,000,000 pre-tax gain on sale of Illinois subsidiary.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 non-interest expense $253,635,000 vs $261,171,000. Q3 1996 non-interest expense includes pre-tax charge of $5,000,000 related to Savings Association Insurance Fund (SAIF).</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.02		    $2.62</p>
<p> Net			356,345		  306,856</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 116,563		  117,199</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 net interest income $1.06 billion vs $958.9 million.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 total non-interest income $374.5 million vs $358.2 million.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 total non-interest expenses $802.8 million vs $798.0 million.</p>
<p>Assets $34.34 billion vs $35.35 billion</p>
<p>Deposits $21.86 billion vs $22.01 billion</p>
<p>Net loans $25.01 billion vs $24.0 billion</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
